OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRain in the east at first,
OL,6,Fclearing southwards through the
OL,7,Fmorning.. Then increasingly bright or
OL,8,Fsunny spells developing during the
OL,9,Fafternoon with the odd shower
OL,10,Fpossible. Mostly light winds, breezier
OL,11,Fnear the coast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FThere will be clear spells
OL,14,Fthrough the evening and overnight with
OL,15,Fa few showers possible. Breezy at
OL,16,Ftimes around northern coasts and a
OL,17,Fchilly night further inland.
OL,18,
OL,19,CFriday:FBright or sunny spells through
OL,20,Fthe day and staying mostly dry with
OL,21,Fjust the odd shower possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
